---
import NavCmstourup from '../../../components/NavCmstourup.astro';
import FooterCmstourup from '../../../components/FooterCmstourup.astro';
import SettingsHead from '../../../components/SettingsHead.astro';
import SettingsBodyEnd from '../../../components/SettingsBodyEnd.astro';
import '../../../styles/theme.css';

export async function getStaticPaths() {
  return [
    { params: { lang: 'en' }, props: { lang: 'en' } },
    { params: { lang: 'es' }, props: { lang: 'es' } },
  ];
}

interface Props { lang: string; }
const { lang } = Astro.props;

const t = (es: string, en: string) => lang === 'en' ? en : es;
const siteUrl = 'https://guia.tourup.co';
const currentPath = `/${lang}/peru/itinerario-14-dias/`;
const canonicalUrl = `${siteUrl}${currentPath}`;

const pageTitle = t(
  "Itinerario de 14 días por Perú: Lima, Cusco, Machu Picchu, Arequipa, Cañón del Colca y Lago Titicaca",
  "14-Day Peru Itinerary: Lima, Cusco, Machu Picchu, Arequipa, Colca Canyon & Lake Titicaca"
);

const pageDesc = t(
  "Planifica 14 días en Perú con este itinerario completo: Lima, Cusco, Valle Sagrado, Machu Picchu, Arequipa, Cañón del Colca, Puno y Lago Titicaca.",
  "Plan 14 days in Peru with this complete itinerary: Lima, Cusco, Sacred Valley, Machu Picchu, Arequipa, Colca Canyon, Puno & Lake Titicaca."
);
---

<!doctype html>
<html class="light" lang={lang}>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <SettingsHead
      title={pageTitle}
      description={pageDesc}
      currentPath={currentPath}
      lang={lang}
    />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:wght,FILL@100..700,0..1&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <meta name="robots" content="index, follow" />
    <style>
      * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
      body { background: var(--color-surface); color: var(--color-on-surface); font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; min-height: 100vh; }
      .main-grid { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 48px 16px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; align-items: start; }
      @media (min-width: 1024px) { .main-grid { grid-template-columns: 8fr 4fr; gap: 32px; } }
      .breadcrumbs { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 12px; color: #3e4851; }
      .breadcrumb-chevron { font-size: 14px !important; line-height: 1; }
      .breadcrumb-current { font-weight: 600; color: #1b1b1d; }
      .breadcrumb-path { color: #a6aab0; font-size: 12px; }
      .hero-section { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; }
      .hero-title { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 36px; color: #1b1b1d; max-width: 768px; }
      @media (min-width: 768px) { .hero-title { font-size: 48px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 56px; } }
      .tags-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-top: 8px; }
      .tag { border: 1px solid #e4e2e4; background: #fcf8fb; border-radius: 9999px; padding: 4px 12px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; color: #3e4851; }
      .tag-fill { background: #f0edef; }
      .hero-summary { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.43; color: #3e4851; max-width: 576px; margin-top: 16px; }
      .hero-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px; margin-top: 16px; }
      .hero-image { width: 100%; margin-top: 24px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #e4e2e4; overflow: hidden; aspect-ratio: 16/9; background: #dcd9dc; }
      .hero-image img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; filter: grayscale(1); opacity: 0.9; }
      .btn-primary { display: inline-block; background: var(--color-primary); color: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 24px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; transition: background 0.1s; border: none; cursor: pointer; text-align: center; }
      .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--color-primary-hover); }
      .btn-ghost { display: inline-block; background: transparent; color: #1b1b1d; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 24px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; border: 1px solid #e4e2e4; transition: background 0.1s; }
      .btn-ghost:hover { background: #f0edef; }
      .btn-full { width: 100%; }
      .cards-stack { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px; }
      .card { background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e4e2e4; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
      .card-accent { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 24px; bottom: 24px; width: 4px; background: var(--color-primary); border-radius: 0 2px 2px 0; }
      .card-title { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 32px; color: #1b1b1d; margin-bottom: 24px; padding-left: 16px; letter-spacing: normal; }
      .card-body { padding-left: 16px; }
      .it-day { padding: 16px 0; }
      .it-day + .it-day { border-top: 1px solid #e4e2e4; }
      .it-day-label { display: inline-block; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-primary); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; margin-bottom: 4px; }
      .it-day h3 { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: #1b1b1d; margin-bottom: 8px; }
      .it-day p { font-size: 14px; color: #3e4851; line-height: 1.6; }
      .budget-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; }
      .budget-list li { font-size: 14px; color: #3e4851; margin-bottom: 12px; line-height: 1.5; padding-left: 0; }
      .budget-list li::before { content: "•"; color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: bold; display: inline-block; width: 16px; margin-left: -16px; }
      .budget-list strong { color: #1b1b1d; font-weight: 600; }
      .faq-item { padding: 20px 0; }
      .faq-item-bordered { border-top: 1px solid #e4e2e4; }
      .faq-q { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; color: #1b1b1d; margin-bottom: 8px; }
      .faq-a { font-size: 14px; color: #3e4851; line-height: 1.5; }
      .prose p { font-size: 14px; color: #3e4851; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px; }
      .prose ul { margin-bottom: 12px; padding-left: 20px; }
      .prose li { font-size: 14px; color: #3e4851; margin-bottom: 6px; line-height: 1.5; }
      .prose strong { color: #1b1b1d; font-weight: 600; }
      .col-sidebar { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px; }
      @media (min-width: 1024px) { .col-sidebar { position: sticky; top: 88px; } }
      .sidebar-card { background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e4e2e4; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; }
      .sidebar-card-alt { background: #fcf8fb; }
      .sidebar-label { display: block; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 500; color: #3e4851; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; margin-bottom: 8px; }
      .price-row { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
      .price-value { font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #1b1b1d; }
      .price-unit { font-size: 14px; color: #3e4851; }
      .price-footnote { text-align: center; font-size: 10px; color: #3e4851; margin-top: 8px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
      .meta-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; font-size: 14px; }
      .meta-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; border-bottom: 1px solid #e4e2e4; padding-bottom: 8px; }
      .meta-label { color: #3e4851; }
      .meta-value { color: #1b1b1d; font-weight: 500; }
      .schema-tags { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; font-size: 14px; }
      .schema-tag { background: #e4e2e4; color: #1b1b1d; padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 12px; }
      .var-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; font-size: 14px; }
      .var-key { color: #1b1b1d; font-weight: 500; }
      .var-val { color: #3e4851; }
      .var-url { word-break: break-all; }
      .internal-links { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
      .internal-link { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; text-decoration: none; color: #1b1b1d; font-size: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e4e2e4; padding-bottom: 8px; transition: color 0.1s; }
      .internal-link:hover { color: #3e4851; }
      .internal-link .material-symbols-outlined { font-size: 14px; color: #a6aab0; }
      .related-list { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
      .related-item { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding-bottom: 8px; }
      .related-item-bordered { border-bottom: 1px solid #e4e2e4; }
      .related-link { color: #1b1b1d; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; transition: color 0.1s; }
      .related-link:hover { color: #3e4851; }
      .related-path { font-size: 12px; color: #3e4851; }

    </style>
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "Trip",
      "name": t("Itinerario de 14 días por Perú", "14-Day Peru Itinerary"),
      "description": t("Lima, Cusco, Machu Picchu, Arequipa, Cañón del Colca, Puno y Lago Titicaca en 14 días", "Lima, Cusco, Machu Picchu, Arequipa, Colca Canyon, Puno & Lake Titicaca in 14 days"),
      "itinerary": [
        { "@type": "City", "name": "Lima" },
        { "@type": "City", "name": "Cusco" },
        { "@type": "TouristAttraction", "name": "Machu Picchu" },
        { "@type": "City", "name": "Arequipa" },
        { "@type": "City", "name": "Puno" }
      ]
    })} />
  </head>

  <body>

    <NavCmstourup lang={lang} />

    <main class="main-grid">

      <div class="col-main">

        <section class="hero-section">
          <div class="breadcrumbs">
            <span>{t('Perú', 'Peru')}</span>
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined breadcrumb-chevron">chevron_right</span>
            <span class="breadcrumb-current">{t('Itinerario 14 días', '14-Day Itinerary')}</span>
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined breadcrumb-chevron">chevron_right</span>
            <span class="breadcrumb-path">/peru/itinerario-14-dias/</span>
          </div>

          <h1 class="hero-title">{pageTitle}</h1>

          <div class="tags-row">
            <span class="tag tag-fill">{t('Itinerario', 'Itinerary')}</span>
            <span class="tag">{t('Actualizada 2026', 'Updated 2026')}</span>
            <span class="tag">{t('Incluye FAQs', 'Includes FAQs')}</span>
          </div>

          <p class="hero-summary">{pageDesc}</p>

          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a href={`/${lang}/peru/cusco/tours/`} class="btn-primary">
              {t('Ver tours en Cusco', 'See tours in Cusco')}
            </a>
            <a href={`/${lang}/peru/itinerario-10-dias/`} class="btn-ghost">
              {t('Itinerario 10 días', '10-day itinerary')}
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="hero-image">
            <img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/3250613/pexels-photo-3250613.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1200" alt="Cusco, Perú" loading="eager" />
          </div>
        </section>

        <div class="cards-stack">

          <article class="card">
            <div class="card-accent"></div>
            <h2 class="card-title">
              {t('Resumen rápido', 'Quick Summary')}
            </h2>
            <div class="card-body prose">
              <p>{t(
                'Este itinerario de 14 días (2 semanas) es la ruta más completa para descubrir Perú en un solo viaje. Cubre los 5 destinos imprescindibles: Lima, Cusco con el Valle Sagrado y Machu Picchu, Arequipa con el Cañón del Colca, y Puno con el Lago Titicaca. Es ideal para viajeros que buscan una experiencia profunda y variada combinando cultura, naturaleza, arqueología y gastronomía.',
                'This 14-day (2-week) itinerary is the most complete route to discover Peru in a single trip. It covers 5 must-see destinations: Lima, Cusco with Sacred Valley and Machu Picchu, Arequipa with Colca Canyon, and Puno with Lake Titicaca. Ideal for travelers wanting a deep and varied experience combining culture, nature, archaeology and gastronomy.'
              )}</p>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <div class="card-accent"></div>
            <h2 class="card-title">
              {t('Día a día', 'Day by Day')}
            </h2>
            <div class="card-body itinerary-list">

              <div class="it-day">
                <span class="it-day-label">{t('Día 1', 'Day 1')}</span>
                <h3>{t('Llegada a Lima', 'Arrival in Lima')}</h3>
                <p>{t(
                  'Llegada al Aeropuerto Internacional Jorge Chávez. Traslado al hotel en Miraflores. Tarde de adaptación. Cena de bienvenida en el Malecón de Miraflores con vista al Pacífico.',
                  'Arrival at Jorge Chávez International Airport. Transfer to hotel in Miraflores. Adaptation afternoon. Welcome dinner on the Miraflores Malecón with Pacific views.'
                )}</p>
              </div>

              <div class="it-day">
                <span class="it-day-label">{t('Día 2', 'Day 2')}</span>
                <h3>{t('Lima — Centro Histórico y gastronomía', 'Lima — Historic Center & Gastronomy')}</h3>
                <p>{t(
                  'Mañana: recorrido por el Centro Histórico (Plaza Mayor, Catedral, Palacio de Gobierno, Catacumbas). Almuerzo en el Mercado de Surquillo con degustación de frutas amazónicas y ceviche. Tarde: Museo Larco y Barranco. Noche: cena de cocina peruana contemporánea.',
                  'Morning: Historic Center tour (Plaza Mayor, Cathedral, Government Palace, Catacombs). Lunch at Surquillo Market with Amazonian fruit tasting and ceviche. Afternoon: Larco Museum and Barranco tour. Evening: contemporary Peruvian cuisine dinner.'
                )}</p>
              </div>

              <div class="it-day">
                <span class="it-day-label">{t('Día 3', 'Day 3')}</span>
                <h3>{t('Vuelo a Cusco — Aclimatación', 'Flight to Cusco — Acclimatization')}</h3>
                <p>{t(
                  'Vuelo matutino a Cusco. Check-in y tarde de aclimatación. Visita ligera a Plaza de Armas, Qoricancha y San Blas. Mate de coca y descanso.',
                  'Morning flight to Cusco. Check-in and acclimatization afternoon. Light visit to Plaza de Armas, Qoricancha and San Blas neighborhood. Coca tea and rest.'
                )}</p>
              </div>

              <div class="it-day">
                <span class="it-day-label">{t('Día 4', 'Day 4')}</span>
                <h3>{t('Cusco — City tour completo', 'Cusco — Full City Tour')}</h3>
                <p>{t(
                  'Mañana: Sacsayhuamán, Qenqo, Puca Pucara y Tambomachay. Almuerzo en San Pedro. Tarde: Mercado de San Pedro y Museo de Arte Precolombino.',
                  'Morning: Sacsayhuamán, Qenqo, Puca Pucara and Tambomachay. Lunch in San Pedro neighborhood. Afternoon: San Pedro Market and Pre-Columbian Art Museum.'
                )}</p>
              </div>

              <div class="it-day">
                <span class="it-day-label">{t('Día 5', 'Day 5')}</span>
                <h3>{t('Valle Sagrado de los Incas', 'Sacred Valley of the Incas')}</h3>
                <p>{t(
                  'Excursión de día completo. Mercado de Pisac, ruinas de Pisac. Almuerzo buffet en Urubamba. Tarde: Ollantaytambo, Moray, salineras de Maras. Retorno a Cusco.',
                  'Full-day excursion. Pisac market and ruins. Buffet lunch in Urubamba. Afternoon: Ollantaytambo fortress, Moray terraces, Maras salt mines. Return to Cusco.'
                )}</p>
              </div>

              <div class="it-day">
                <span class="it-day-label">{t('Día 6', 'Day 6')}</span>
                <h3>{t('Machu Picchu', 'Machu Picchu')}</h3>
                <p>{t(
                  'Salida 4:30 am. Tren a Aguas Calientes. Bus a la ciudadela. Visita guiada (Circuito 2). Opción de subir Huayna Picchu o Montaña Machu Picchu (requiere reserva anticipada). Retorno en tren a Cusco.',
                  'Departure 4:30 am. Train to Aguas Calientes. Bus to the citadel. Guided tour of the wonder of the world (Circuit 2). Option to climb Huayna Picchu or Machu Picchu Mountain (requires advance reservation). Return train to Cusco.'
                )}</p>
              </div>

              <div class="it-day">
                <span class="it-day-label">{t('Día 7', 'Day 7')}</span>
                <h3>{t('Montaña 7 Colores o Humantay', 'Rainbow Mountain or Humantay')}</h3>
                <p>{t(
                  'Excursión de día completo a Vinicunca (5,200 msnm) o Laguna Humantay (4,200 msnm). Experiencia de alta montaña con paisajes espectaculares.',
                  'Full-day excursion to Vinicunca Rainbow Mountain (17,000 ft) or Humantay Lagoon (13,800 ft). High mountain experience with spectacular landscapes.'
                )}</p>
              </div>

              <div class="it-day">
                <span class="it-day-label">{t('Día 8', 'Day 8')}</span>
                <h3>{t('Vuelo a Arequipa', 'Flight to Arequipa')}</h3>
                <p>{t(
                  'Mañana libre para compras en San Blas. Vuelo Cusco-Arequipa (1 hora). Tarde: city tour de la Ciudad Blanca (Plaza de Armas, Catedral, Monasterio de Santa Catalina). Cena con rocoto relleno.',
                  'Free morning for shopping in San Blas. Flight Cusco to Arequipa (1 hour). Afternoon: White City tour (Plaza de Armas, Cathedral, Santa Catalina Monastery). Dinner with rocoto relleno.'
                )}</p>
              </div>

              <div class="it-day">
                <span class="it-day-label">{t('Día 9', 'Day 9')}</span>
                <h3>{t('Arequipa — Cultura y museos', 'Arequipa — Culture & Museums')}</h3>
                <p>{t(
                  'Mañana: Museo Santuarios Andinos (momía Juanita), miradores Yanahuara y Carmen Alto. Tarde: barrio San Lázaro y Casa del Moral.',
                  'Morning: Andean Sanctuaries Museum (Juanita mummy), Yanahuara and Carmen Alto viewpoints. Afternoon: San Lázaro neighborhood and Casa del Moral.'
                )}</p>
              </div>

              <div class="it-day">
                <span class="it-day-label">{t('Día 10', 'Day 10')}</span>
                <h3>{t('Cañón del Colca — Ida', 'Colca Canyon — Outward')}</h3>
                <p>{t(
                  'Salida 6:00 am hacia el Cañón del Colca. Parada en el mirador de los Volcanes y Reserva de Vicuñas. Llegada a Chivay. Almuerzo y tarde en las aguas termales de la Calera. Pernocte en Chivay.',
                  'Departure 6:00 am to Colca Canyon. Stop at Volcano Viewpoint and Vicuña Reserve. Arrival in Chivay. Lunch and afternoon at La Calera hot springs. Overnight in Chivay.'
                )}</p>
              </div>

              <div class="it-day">
                <span class="it-day-label">{t('Día 11', 'Day 11')}</span>
                <h3>{t('Cañón del Colca — Cruz del Cóndor y retorno', 'Colca Canyon — Cruz del Cóndor & Return')}</h3>
                <p>{t(
                  'Amanecer en la Cruz del Cóndor (7:00-8:00 am). Observación de cóndores sobre el cañón. Retorno a Arequipa visitando Yanque, Maca y miradores.',
                  'Sunrise at Cruz del Cóndor (7:00-8:00 am). Condor watching over the canyon. Return to Arequipa visiting Yanque, Maca, and viewpoints.'
                )}</p>
              </div>

              <div class="it-day">
                <span class="it-day-label">{t('Día 12', 'Day 12')}</span>
                <h3>{t('Traslado a Puno — Ruta terrestre', 'Transfer to Puno — Land Route')}</h3>
                <p>{t(
                  'Salida temprano hacia Puno (6-7 horas). Parada en el mirador de Lagunillas y Reserva Salinas y Aguada Blanca. Llegada a Puno al atardecer. Hotel frente al Lago Titicaca.',
                  'Early departure to Puno by land route (6-7 hours). Stop at Lagunillas viewpoint and Salinas y Aguada Blanca Reserve. Arrival in Puno at sunset. Hotel facing Lake Titicaca.'
                )}</p>
              </div>

              <div class="it-day">
                <span class="it-day-label">{t('Día 13', 'Day 13')}</span>
                <h3>{t('Lago Titicaca — Uros y Taquile', 'Lake Titicaca — Uros & Taquile')}</h3>
                <p>{t(
                  'Navegación por el Lago Titicaca. Visita a las Islas Flotantes de los Uros (construidas de totora). Continuación a la Isla Taquile (textiles, Patrimonio de la Humanidad UNESCO). Almuerzo en Taquile. Retorno a Puno.',
                  'Navigation on Lake Titicaca. Visit to Uros Floating Islands (built of totora reeds). Continue to Taquile Island (textiles, UNESCO heritage). Lunch on Taquile. Return to Puno.'
                )}</p>
              </div>

              <div class="it-day">
                <span class="it-day-label">{t('Día 14', 'Day 14')}</span>
                <h3>{t('Retorno', 'Return')}</h3>
                <p>{t(
                  'Mañana libre para mirador Kuntur Wasi y paseo por la costanera de Puno. Vuelo Puno a Lima (vía Juliaca). Conexión con vuelo internacional de retorno.',
                  'Free morning for Kuntur Wasi viewpoint and Puno boardwalk. Flight Puno to Lima (via Juliaca). Connection with international return flight.'
                )}</p>
              </div>

            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <div class="card-accent"></div>
            <h2 class="card-title">
              {t('Presupuesto estimado por persona', 'Estimated Budget Per Person')}
            </h2>
            <div class="card-body">
              <ul class="budget-list">
                <li><strong>{t('Económico (1,800-2,200 USD):', 'Budget ($1,800-2,200 USD):')}</strong> {t('hostales, comidas en mercados, tours compartidos, tren Expedition, buses.', 'hostels, market meals, shared tours, Expedition train, buses.')}</li>
                <li><strong>{t('Estándar (2,800-3,600 USD):', 'Standard ($2,800-3,600 USD):')}</strong> {t('hoteles 3 estrellas, tours grupales con guía, tren Vistadome, vuelos internos.', '3-star hotels, group tours with guide, Vistadome train, domestic flights.')}</li>
                <li><strong>{t('Premium (desde 4,500 USD):', 'Premium (from $4,500 USD):')}</strong> {t('hoteles 4-5 estrellas, tours privados, tren Hiram Bingham, guía bilingüe personal.', '4-5 star hotels, private tours, Hiram Bingham train, personal bilingual guide.')}</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <div class="card-accent"></div>
            <h2 class="card-title">
              {t('Preguntas frecuentes', 'Frequently Asked Questions')}
            </h2>
            <div class="card-body faq-list">
              <div class="faq-item">
                <h3 class="faq-q">{t('¿Es realista este itinerario de 14 días?', 'Is this 14-day itinerary realistic?')}</h3>
                <p class="faq-a">{t(
                  'Sí, es realista y probado por miles de viajeros. Incluye vuelos internos para los tramos largos y un traslado terrestre escénico de Arequipa a Puno. El ritmo es activo pero cada ciudad tiene 2-3 noches.',
                  'Yes, it\'s realistic and tested by thousands of travelers. It includes domestic flights for long stretches and a scenic land transfer from Arequipa to Puno. The pace is active but each city has 2-3 nights.'
                )}</p>
              </div>
              <div class="faq-item faq-item-bordered">
                <h3 class="faq-q">{t('¿Qué nivel de condición física se requiere?', 'What fitness level is required?')}</h3>
                <p class="faq-a">{t(
                  'Nivel moderado. Machu Picchu requiere caminar por escaleras incas (2-3 horas de caminata moderada). La Montaña 7 Colores es exigente por la altitud (5,200 msnm). El Cañón del Colca tiene altitud similar pero menos esfuerzo físico.',
                  'Moderate level. Machu Picchu involves Inca stairways (2-3 hours moderate walking). Rainbow Mountain is challenging due to altitude (17,000 ft). Colca Canyon involves similar altitude but less physical effort.'
                )}</p>
              </div>
              <div class="faq-item faq-item-bordered">
                <h3 class="faq-q">{t('¿Es mejor hacer este itinerario en orden inverso?', 'Is it better to do this itinerary in reverse?')}</h3>
                <p class="faq-a">{t(
                  'Sí, empezar por Arequipa (2,335 msnm) y subir gradualmente a Cusco (3,400 msnm) y Puno (3,830 msnm) facilita la aclimatación a la altura. Sin embargo, el orden propuesto (Lima → Cusco → Arequipa → Puno) es más eficiente en vuelos. Si te preocupa la altura, añade 1 día extra de aclimatación en Cusco.',
                  'Yes, starting in Arequipa (7,660 ft) and gradually ascending to Cusco (11,200 ft) and Puno (12,550 ft) makes altitude acclimatization easier. However, the proposed order (Lima → Cusco → Arequipa → Puno) is more flight-efficient. If altitude concerns you, add 1 extra acclimatization day in Cusco.'
                )}</p>
              </div>
              <div class="faq-item faq-item-bordered">
                <h3 class="faq-q">{t('¿Cuánto cuestan los vuelos internos?', 'How much do domestic flights cost?')}</h3>
                <p class="faq-a">{t(
                  'Lima-Cusco (80-150 USD), Cusco-Arequipa (60-100 USD), Juliaca-Lima (80-130 USD). Total aproximado: 250-400 USD por persona si se reserva con anticipación.',
                  'Lima-Cusco ($80-150), Cusco-Arequipa ($60-100), Juliaca-Lima ($80-130). Total approximately $250-400 per person if booked in advance.'
                )}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

        </div>
